    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17653" root="زرد" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُزَرَّدٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزْرَدٌ</span>. One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذَ بِمُزَرَّدِهِ</span>, like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذَ بِمُخَنَّقِهِ</span>, [properly <i>He,</i> or <i>it, seized his
throat,</i> or <i>throttled him,</i> or <i>choked him,</i>] meaning
(tropical:)  <i>he,</i> or <i>it, straitened him.</i> (A, TA.)

